Server init.
>> a := Blob berria: 4.
a bytes: ( Zerrenda berria ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob berria: 4.
b bytes: ( Zerrenda berria ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a berria.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Irteera idatzi: ['xorred:'], lerro-jauzia. 
Irteera idatzi: n, lerro-jauzia. 
} harrapatu: { :e Irteera idatzi: e, lerro-jauzia. }, hasi.
a askatu.
b askatu.
